  "name": "Casdoor",
  "abstract": "Open-source identity and access management and SSO platform with a web console, written in Go and React. One user directory is exposed over OAuth 2.0, OpenID Connect, SAML 2.0, CAS, LDAP and SCIM 2.0, with passwordless, WebAuthn, Face ID and over 100 social and enterprise sign-in providers, multi-factor authentication, organizations, roles and permissions, webhooks and a REST API. Also covers SaaS building blocks (plans, products, subscriptions, payments) and AI use cases through a built-in MCP server and OAuth 2.1 dynamic client registration. Self-host it under the Apache-2.0 license, or use Casdoor Cloud, a dedicated managed instance run by Casbin Inc.",
